  prompt: {fileID: 1213375629}
  bubble: {fileID: 1816031548}
  lines:
  - "Ch\xE0o {name}! \u0110\u1ED3ng C\u1ECF Gi\xF3 \u1EDF ph\xEDa \u0111\xF4ng, qua c\u1ED5ng rune. Nh\u1EDB mua thu\u1ED1c \u1EDF ch\u1ED7 M\u1ED9c Linh tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi \u0111i."
  - "Gi\xF3 h\xF4m nay l\xE0nh l\u1EAFm. H\u1EA1 v\xE0i con Slime r\u1ED3i v\u1EC1 k\u1EC3 ta nghe nh\xE9."
  range: 2.4
